    <string name="wesh_pave_internet_disclosure_full">Internet mode goes through Tor and public Nostr relays that Wesh does not run. Relays see neither your IP address nor the content, but they see the recipient’s Internet key, the time and size of messages, and can link what you send to your key. They may keep the encrypted messages. Anyone with your QR code knows your Internet key. Off by default; emergency erase turns it off.</string>
